WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:14.375 --> 00:00:15.875
C’mon, Ben. Take a three-pointer

00:00:15.875 --> 00:00:16.750
What are you afraid of?

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:18.750
Oh, right...the fact that it definitely won’t go in

00:00:19.041 --> 00:00:21.625
This guy talks more trash than a young Kobe

00:00:21.625 --> 00:00:24.083
And also takes more bad shots than the old one

00:00:24.083 --> 00:00:26.166
At least I take shots, Benny one-point

00:00:26.166 --> 00:00:27.000
All right, just roll

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:28.583
Some of us actually have real games to play

00:00:28.583 --> 00:00:29.166
Rude

00:00:29.541 --> 00:00:31.458
All right, I’ll fake the pass and then drive the lane

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:34.125
Ugh, four

00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:35.250
Oof, that’s a turnover

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:38.250
Ooh, mistakes like that can cost you Squire of the Year

00:00:38.625 --> 00:00:40.500
But I guess you can always try again next year

00:00:40.625 --> 00:00:41.541
Whose turn is it?

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:43.500
I think it’s...Fultz. You’re up

00:00:43.791 --> 00:00:45.416
No, thanks. I’m not ready

00:00:45.625 --> 00:00:46.541
What’s happening here?

00:00:46.833 --> 00:00:48.416
Wait, you got the new 1K?

00:00:48.416 --> 00:00:49.291
Yeah, just came out

00:00:49.291 --> 00:00:50.833
But, it’s the end of the season

00:00:50.833 --> 00:00:53.000
Well, they’ve got to hand-carve all the graphics, Lonzo

00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:53.916
How is it?

00:00:53.916 --> 00:00:55.041
It’s pretty realistic

00:00:55.166 --> 00:00:57.291
Except they made my hair look painted on

00:00:57.291 --> 00:00:58.958
That’s because it does look painted on

00:00:58.958 --> 00:01:00.458
Oh, says Mona Lisa over here

00:01:00.458 --> 00:01:01.750
Well–can I see mine?

00:01:01.916 --> 00:01:03.500
Sure, let me find it

00:01:04.125 --> 00:01:05.125
Here’s Gordon Hayward

00:01:06.291 --> 00:01:07.125
Derrick Rose

00:01:07.125 --> 00:01:08.291
Ah, crap

00:01:09.291 --> 00:01:10.125
Klay Thompson

00:01:10.125 --> 00:01:12.250
Wow, graphics are uncanny

00:01:12.416 --> 00:01:13.833
Ah, here ya go, found Lonzo

00:01:13.916 --> 00:01:14.916
Oh thanks

00:01:14.916 --> 00:01:16.958
I think–wait, I think that’s Michael Carter-Williams

00:01:16.958 --> 00:01:17.333
Ugh

00:01:17.333 --> 00:01:17.916
[laughing]

00:01:17.916 --> 00:01:18.583
Very funny

00:01:18.916 --> 00:01:21.041
Lonzo, your rating’s actually pretty solid

00:01:21.166 --> 00:01:22.208
What about mine?

00:01:22.208 --> 00:01:23.208
Um

00:01:23.583 --> 00:01:24.416
You know

00:01:24.416 --> 00:01:26.125
This doesn’t look anything like me

00:01:26.125 --> 00:01:28.166
I guess they got lazy towards the back of the draft

00:01:28.166 --> 00:01:29.500
Well, what’s my rating?

00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:30.500
It's a 72

00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:33.458
What? I’m a 72 and Lonzo is an 80?

00:01:33.708 --> 00:01:35.333
Weren’t you in a bloody egg last year?

00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:37.791
Yeah, but that was like a special magical thing

00:01:37.791 --> 00:01:40.458
It’s probably changed, it’s just that we haven’t gotten the update raven

00:01:40.458 --> 00:01:41.791
Why don’t you just create your own knight?

00:01:41.791 --> 00:01:43.500
[sigh] I suppose I should

00:01:43.666 --> 00:01:45.125
Ugh, what are those?

00:01:45.125 --> 00:01:46.708
Those are your default 1K boots

00:01:46.708 --> 00:01:47.458
You start with them

00:01:47.458 --> 00:01:49.708
Nay, little me can’t be seen in these

00:01:49.708 --> 00:01:50.416
C’mon now

00:01:50.416 --> 00:01:53.333
You can purchase swag for your character from Ronnie 1k over there

00:01:53.666 --> 00:01:55.041
But I’ll warn you, it gets expensive

00:01:55.041 --> 00:01:56.791
500 coppers for boots?

00:01:57.250 --> 00:01:58.083
That’s madness

00:01:59.458 --> 00:02:01.333
Huh, well, you can’t put a price on style

00:02:01.750 --> 00:02:02.875
I’m going to fancy up me character

00:02:02.875 --> 00:02:03.875
Don’t start without me, alright?

00:02:06.083 --> 00:02:08.333
Hey, uh...you Ronnie 1K?

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:09.250
That’s right, fam

00:02:09.458 --> 00:02:09.875
I am

00:02:10.083 --> 00:02:12.333
Well, I’d like to try out some of your haircuts please

00:02:12.333 --> 00:02:13.250
No samples!

00:02:13.250 --> 00:02:14.250
You try, you buy

00:02:14.250 --> 00:02:15.541
[scoffs] C'mon

00:02:15.833 --> 00:02:18.791
Well then, I’d like your finest fur coat for my little knight

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:20.500
That’ll be 100 VC

00:02:21.083 --> 00:02:22.208
What–what's VC?

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:23.625
Virtual coppers

00:02:23.791 --> 00:02:24.625
Uh, OK

00:02:24.833 --> 00:02:25.458
Here

00:02:25.458 --> 00:02:27.458
No, the–these are real coppers

00:02:27.583 --> 00:02:29.583
We only take virtual coppers

00:02:29.583 --> 00:02:31.708
Well then, how do I get virtual coppers?

00:02:31.708 --> 00:02:33.125
You pay me real coppers

00:02:33.125 --> 00:02:34.041
Are you–uh

00:02:34.291 --> 00:02:34.833
Right

00:02:35.291 --> 00:02:38.250
So, can I get 100 virtual coppers?

00:02:39.583 --> 00:02:40.583
There you are

00:02:41.750 --> 00:02:42.458
It’s empty

00:02:42.833 --> 00:02:45.583
Well, that’s cause you just went and spilled ‘em all over the floor

00:02:46.416 --> 00:02:47.625
Inbound to Lonzo

00:02:47.625 --> 00:02:48.791
What do I do?

00:02:48.791 --> 00:02:50.125
First, call out your move

00:02:50.125 --> 00:02:52.041
You’re on a team with Kuz and Donovan

00:02:52.291 --> 00:02:53.708
Markelle, you ready?

00:02:54.250 --> 00:02:55.041
No

00:02:55.875 --> 00:02:58.833
OK, I’ll send a full-court pass to Mitchell

00:02:58.833 --> 00:02:59.833
Alright, roll for it

00:03:01.375 --> 00:03:02.375
[dice on floor]

00:03:05.083 --> 00:03:05.958
OK

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:10.291
Now, I’ve now picked up all 100 of my virtual coppers

00:03:10.291 --> 00:03:11.750
off the floor

00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:13.583
and I am handing them to you

00:03:14.125 --> 00:03:16.041
Please give me the fur coat

00:03:16.041 --> 00:03:16.916
[laughs]

00:03:16.916 --> 00:03:17.958
Nice try

00:03:17.958 --> 00:03:18.625
What?

00:03:18.625 --> 00:03:19.833
You're three short!

00:03:21.250 --> 00:03:23.958
So after the battle, you run into Matt Barnes

00:03:23.958 --> 00:03:28.750
He asks you if you’d like to join him on a 95-mile quest to kick Derek Fisher’s ass

00:03:28.750 --> 00:03:33.500
Do you say (A) Violence is never the answer or (B) But sometimes it is?

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:35.666
Ugh, seven hells, this is so boring

00:03:35.666 --> 00:03:36.666
Can we skip this?

00:03:36.666 --> 00:03:37.666
Nope, sorry

00:03:37.666 --> 00:03:39.875
According to the rules, you can’t skip the woodcut scenes

00:03:39.875 --> 00:03:40.583
All right

00:03:40.875 --> 00:03:44.583
Pure sharp, Demigod, Alpha Dog with Limitless Range

00:03:44.583 --> 00:03:45.916
Y’all are barbeque chicken

00:03:45.916 --> 00:03:47.041
Damn, Kuz

00:03:47.041 --> 00:03:49.791
And it only costs me 20,000 coppers and three of me goats

00:03:49.833 --> 00:03:51.458
All right Kuz, get in

00:03:51.833 --> 00:03:53.416
Fultz, the game is almost over

00:03:53.416 --> 00:03:54.625
You sure you don’t want to sub in?

00:03:54.625 --> 00:03:55.916
OK, I’m ready

00:03:56.166 --> 00:03:58.333
Um...hesi pull-up jimbo top of the key

00:03:59.791 --> 00:04:00.541
Oops

00:04:01.916 --> 00:04:02.208
All right

00:04:02.916 --> 00:04:03.916
My ball

00:04:04.458 --> 00:04:05.916
Two points away from the win

00:04:06.666 --> 00:04:08.625
I want to dunk over Ben Simmons

00:04:08.625 --> 00:04:12.375
[laughs] Uh, you know I’m a wee bit taller than Kevin Hart, right?

00:04:12.541 --> 00:04:14.083
All right, well, we’ll find out. Roll for it

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:16.458
Boom!

00:04:16.791 --> 00:04:17.791
Eighteen!

00:04:17.791 --> 00:04:18.625
I win!

00:04:18.875 --> 00:04:20.666
Who says I’m not Squire of the Year?

00:04:20.916 --> 00:04:21.916
Actually, no

00:04:22.416 --> 00:04:23.166
You miss

00:04:23.166 --> 00:04:25.500
What do–miss? How? On an 18?

00:04:25.583 --> 00:04:27.333
Yeah, I mean your dunk rating

00:04:27.333 --> 00:04:29.291
It says here your dunk rating’s only 50

00:04:29.291 --> 00:04:29.625
A 50?!

00:04:29.625 --> 00:04:31.750
A 50?!
You need to roll a 20 to pull off a stunt like that

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:33.166
Well that’s horse manure

00:04:33.166 --> 00:04:35.125
I won the bloody dunk contest!

00:04:35.125 --> 00:04:36.583
At least, I still haven’t received an update

00:04:36.583 --> 00:04:37.666
Hey, Ronnie!

00:04:37.666 --> 00:04:39.958
Fix your bloody 1K server ravens!

00:04:39.958 --> 00:04:42.125
I’ll bet by the time that update gets here

00:04:42.125 --> 00:04:43.875
I’ll have already have won Squire of the Year

00:04:43.875 --> 00:04:47.541
May I just mention that I’m the third-leading scorer on the second-best house in the East

00:04:47.541 --> 00:04:49.875
despite devastating injuries to our finest knights?

00:04:49.916 --> 00:04:51.625
I think that deserves some consideration

00:04:51.625 --> 00:04:53.250
Well, if either of your houses were in the West

00:04:53.250 --> 00:04:55.416
You wouldn’t even be considered for Squire of the Year

00:04:55.416 --> 00:04:57.583
Stop your squabbling, children

00:04:58.250 --> 00:05:01.041
The damn Squire of the Year award is overrated

00:05:01.666 --> 00:05:05.958
By this time next year, nobody will even remember who won

00:05:05.958 --> 00:05:07.750
Oh, yeah? And who the hell are you?

